      "review_date": "2022-11-22",
      "review_datetime_iso": "2022-11-22T16:35:27.181445",
      "review_text": "I came to Auckland in September, went around everywhere and tried a couple of cafes and my heart is sold to Once More - Cafe & Store !\nI'm a coffee person and let me tell you, the drinks that were served to me were out of this world. It's a must try place ! Also, please drink at the cafe instead of doing the takeaways cause the vibes are so cozy !\nThe interior is so cute and amazing, it feels like home. It makes you feel like you want to work there. I would love to work :)\nKudos to the team for brewing such amazing coffee and keeping the decoration friendly and just wholesome.",
